score_spread":null,"_gate_roic_consistency":null,"_gp_roic_consistency":null,"_score_roic_consistency":null,"_gate_incr_roic":null,"_gp_incr_roic":null,"_score_incr_roic":null,"_gate_margin_advantage":null,"_gp_margin_advantage":null,"_score_margin_advantage":null,"_gate_pool_share":0.08098579811916862,"_gp_pool_share":true,"_score_pool_share":72.4,"_gate_rev_durability":0.11603558860307372,"_gp_rev_durability":true,"_score_rev_durability":83.0,"_gate_fcf_durability":null,"_gp_fcf_durability":null,"_score_fcf_durability":null,"_gate_margins":null,"_gp_margins":null,"_score_margins":null,"_gate_fund_growth":null,"_gp_fund_growth":null,"_score_fund_growth":null,"_gate_shrhldr_yield":0.012808349449755263,"_gp_shrhldr_yield":false,"_score_shrhldr_yield":25.3,"_gate_share_shrink":-0.01524681885369128,"_gp_share_shrink":true,"_score_share_shrink":69.1,"_gate_sbc_dilution":0.01596279537456008,"_gp_sbc_dilution":true,"_score_sbc_dilution":73.4,"_gate_insider_own":0.10566,"_gp_insider_own":true,"_score_insider_own":70.4,"_gate_insider_buying":0.0,"_gp_insider_buying":false,"_score_insider_buying":0.0,"pf":[],"description_full":"Raymond James Financial, Inc., a diversified financial services company, provides private client group, capital markets, asset management, banking, and other services to individuals, corporations, and municipalities in the United States, Canada, and Europe. The Private Client Group segment offers financial planning, investment advisory, securities transaction, investment services, portfolio management services, insurance and annuity products, and mutual funds; support to third-party mutual fund and annuity companies, including sales and marketing support, as well as distribution and accounting, and administrative services; margin loans; securities borrowing and lending services; and custodial, trade execution, research, and other support and services. The Capital Markets segment provides investment banking services, such as equity and debt underwriting, and merger and acquisition advisory; and fixed income and equity brokerage services. This segment also offers institutional sales, securities trading, equity research, and the syndication and management of investments in low-income housing funds and funds of a similar nature. The Asset Management segment provides asset management, portfolio management, and related administrative services to retail and institutional clients; and administrative support services, such as record-keeping. The Bank segment offers various types of loans, including securities-based, corporate, commercial and industrial, commercial real estate and construction, real estate investment trust, residential mortgage, and tax-exempt loans; Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation-insured deposit accounts; retail and corporate deposit; and liquidity management products and services. The Other segment engages in the private equity investments comprising investments in third-party funds. The company offers corporate, retail banking and trust services. Raymond James Financial, Inc. was founded in 1962 and is headquartered in Saint Petersburg, Florida.","ceo_bio":"Mr. Paul Marone Shoukry | CEO & Director | Age 42 | Compensation: $8.7M (FY2025)","culture_narrative":"Governance score flags low compensation governance risk (3/10).","financial_summary":["Raymond James Financial, Inc. is a large-cap financial services business with a $32.4B market cap on $15.9B of annual revenue.","The top line has compounded at +12% over the past three years and +12% annually across the full decade, the kind of sustained demand persistence that marks a compounder.","Returns on capital run at 70% against a 10% cost of capital \u2014 a 60-point spread that is the clearest signature of an economic moat.","The business throws off $2.2B in free cash flow \u2014 roughly 14 cents on every revenue dollar, which is the owner-earnings figure that actually belongs to shareholders, and cash conversion sits at 1.14\u00d7 so those profits are backed by real cash.","On the balance sheet, the balance sheet carries net cash, which is the gold standard: the business never has to make desperate decisions in a bad year.","Shareholder yield is only 1.3%, a thin return of capital, and insiders hold 11% of the shares, so management thinks like owners because it is one \u2014 the strongest alignment there is."],"sector_headwinds":[{"text":"Altman Z in the distress zone (0.7) \u2014 the kind of balance-sheet risk that can make a loss permanent","sev":"red","cat":"quality"},{"text":"Low reinvestment-driven growth suggests the compounding engine has stalled","sev":"amber","cat":"growth"},{"text":"Volatile returns on capital suggest the moat is narrower than a snapshot ROIC implies","sev":"amber","cat":"moat"},{"text":"Significant insider selling (net $9.1M)","sev":"amber","cat":"insider","dollars":-9063934.45},{"text":"Credit cycles and regulatory capital \u2014 losses accumulate invisibly in good years and appear all at once, and the time to worry is when underwriting standards are loosest.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Fintech disintermediation \u2014 neobanks, embedded finance, and blockchain rails are unbundling the fee streams that traditional banks took for granted.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"},{"text":"Interest rate regime shifts \u2014 a rapid move in rates can invert the yield curve, crush bond portfolios, and trigger deposit flight simultaneously.","sev":"amber","cat":"thesis_risk"}],"sector_tailwinds":["Trading at a 45% margin of safety to estimated fair value \u2014 a real cushion against errors in the estimate","Market is pricing in lower growth than the company has historically delivered","39 consecutive years of dividend payments \u2014 an operating record that makes the dividend claim credible","Healthy payout ratio leaves room for both dividend growth and reinvestment","ROIC sits in the top quartile of Financial Services peers \u2014 the moat is wider than the neighbourhood","Among the least levered in Financial Services \u2014 the fortress balance sheet in its peer set","Minimal goodwill on the balance sheet \u2014 low impairment risk"],"news_headlines":[{"title":"National Bank Financial Reiterates \u201cC$4.50\u201d Price Target for Timbercreek Financial (TSE:TF)","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/13/national-bank-financial-reiterates-c4-50-price-target-for-timbercreek-financial-tsetf.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794600782.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.511,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":["analyst_action"]},{"title":"Desjardins Forecasts Strong Price Appreciation for PRO Real Estate Investment Trust (CVE:PRV.UN) Stock","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/13/desjardins-forecasts-strong-price-appreciation-for-pro-real-estate-investment-trust-cveprv-un-stock.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794600430.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.958,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":["guidance"]},{"title":"Sienna Senior Living (TSE:SIA) Announces Quarterly Earnings Results","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/13/sienna-senior-living-tsesia-announces-quarterly-earnings-results.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794598010.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.511,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":["earnings"]},{"title":"Devon Energy (DVN) \u2013 Research Analysts\u2019 Weekly Ratings Changes","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/13/devon-energy-dvn-research-analysts-weekly-ratings-changes.html","date":"2026-11-13","timestamp":1794594477.0,"origin":"tiingo","sentiment":0.772,"tier":2,"scope":"company","tags":[]},{"title":"WhiteHawk Income (NYSE:WHK) Releases Earnings Results, Misses Estimates By $0.12 EPS","source":"thelincolnianonline.com","link":"https://www.thelincolnianonline.com/2026/11/13/whitehawk-income-nysewhk-releas